---@class posthog.query.MarketingAnalyticsAttributionQuery
---@field aggregation_group_type_index? number|distilled.Null Groups aggregation - not used in Web Analytics but required for type compatibility
---@field allowMultipleConversionsPerVisitor? boolean|distilled.Null Whether one person converting repeatedly counts once or every time. Null follows the goal's own math: unique-users goals count each person once, count-based goals count every conversion. Set explicitly to override. Counting every conversion makes the rate columns exceed 100%, since a person can convert more times than they visited.
---@field breakdownBy? posthog.query.MarketingAnalyticsAttributionBreakdown|string|distilled.Null Row dimension. Defaults to channel.
---@field conversionGoal? posthog.query.MarketingAnalyticsAttributionQueryConversionGoal|distilled.Null
---@field conversionGoalId string conversion_goal_id of the goal to attribute. The table is meaningless without one.
---@field dataColorTheme? number|distilled.Null Colors used in the insight's visualization - not used in Web Analytics but required for type compatibility
---@field dateRange? posthog.query.DateRange|distilled.Null
