---@field response? posthog.query.MetricsQueryResponse|distilled.Null
---@field sql? string|distilled.Null HogQL SELECT over the posthog.metric* tables. Used when `language` is `sql`. It must return a `time` and a `value` column; every other column is a series label. `{date_from}`, `{date_to}`, `{interval}` and `{interval_seconds}` are filled in from the date range and interval.
