---@class posthog.query.QueryScanAnalysis
---@field assistant_prompt? string|distilled.Null The message the Fix with AI button sends to the assistant. Absent when no finding can be fixed in the query.
---@field findings posthog.query.QueryScanAnalysisFindingsList Every finding, fixable or not. Empty when the analysis found none.
---@field project_share? number|distilled.Null How much of all the project's events the query read, 0 to 1.
---@field range_share? number|distilled.Null How much of the project's events in the query's date range the query read, 0 to 1.

---Every finding, fixable or not. Empty when the analysis found none.
---@alias posthog.query.QueryScanAnalysisFindingsList posthog.query.QueryScanWarning[]

---@alias posthog.query.QueryScanFindingKind "no_event_filter"|"no_start_date"|"persons_join"

---@alias posthog.query.QueryScanFixLocation "query"|"subquery"|"view"|"insight_date_range"|"dashboard_date_filter"

---@class posthog.query.QueryScanResponse
---@field analysis? posthog.query.QueryScanAnalysis|distilled.Null

---@class posthog.query.QueryScanSummary
---@field analysis? posthog.query.QueryScanAnalysis|distilled.Null The stored analysis, put on the response when it is served. Absent while the analysis runs, and when none was requested.
---@field analysis_requested? boolean|distilled.Null True when the run asked for an analysis, or found one stored. While `analysis` is absent, poll `GET /query/scan/{cache_key}` for it.
---@field duration_ms number ClickHouse time for the last fresh run, summed over its ClickHouse queries.
---@field killed? boolean|distilled.Null True when ClickHouse stopped the run instead of finishing it.
---@field rows_read number Rows ClickHouse read for the last fresh run, all tables included.

---@class posthog.query.QueryScanWarning
---@field actionable boolean Whether the person can change the query so it reads less and still answers the same question. Surfaces show the full advice and "Fix with AI" only when a finding is actionable.
---@field by_design? boolean|distilled.Null True when the query reads this much on purpose, so reading less would change the answer. Absent means no.
---@field cause? string|distilled.Null A label for what in the query text kept the read wide, such as `in_or`. Only analytics and the assistant read it, and the labels can change.
---@field evidence? string|distilled.Null The one fact the finding rests on.
---@field fix string What "Fix with AI" and the assistant are told to do.
---@field fix_location? posthog.query.QueryScanFixLocation|string|distilled.Null Where the change goes. Absent means the query itself.
---@field kind posthog.query.QueryScanFindingKind|string
---@field message string Shown to the person: what happened and what to do.

---@class posthog.query.QueryStatus
---@field budget_remaining_bytes? number|distilled.Null
---@field bytes_read? number|distilled.Null
---@field cache_key? string|distilled.Null Cache key of the run that failed, so clients can ask for its query scan.
---@field complete? boolean|distilled.Null Whether the query is still running. Will be true if the query is complete, even if it errored. Either result or error will be set.
---@field dashboard_id? number|distilled.Null
---@field end_time? string|distilled.Null When did the query execution task finish (whether successfully or not).
---@field error? boolean|distilled.Null If the query failed, this will be set to true. More information can be found in the error_message field.
---@field error_code? string|distilled.Null Stable machine-readable code for the error, when known: the DRF exception code, the ClickHouse error name, the HogQL error code, or `unhandled_<exception class>` for a failure that no handler classified.
---@field error_message? string|distilled.Null
---@field expiration_time? string|distilled.Null
---@field id? string
---@field insight_id? number|distilled.Null
---@field labels? posthog.query.QueryStatusLabelsList|distilled.Null
---@field pickup_time? string|distilled.Null When was the query execution task picked up by a worker.
---@field query_async? boolean ONLY async queries use QueryStatus.
---@field query_progress? posthog.query.ClickhouseQueryProgress|distilled.Null
---@field query_scan? posthog.query.QueryScanSummary|distilled.Null
---@field results? any
---@field start_time? string|distilled.Null When was query execution task enqueued.
---@field task_id? string|distilled.Null
---@field team_id? number

